{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "iaeivtui729k0z2p", "title": "38.解释FlashAttention的显存优化原理", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h3 data-lake-id=\"83d4d33c\" id=\"83d4d33c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u311be7cd\" id=\"u311be7cd\">一、答题思路</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"udde9dc47\" id=\"udde9dc47\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1751689344180-3a811d6a-cfc2-4ae7-8d0c-7a90ab4eb630.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u0d18d815-e18d-4075-a7f7-d1c878379e4%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u1863dcd2-f6e4-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A470.4%2C%22height%22%3A265%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A85172%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A882%2C%22originHeight%22%3A496%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.875%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8C%BB%E5%AD%A6%E5%BD%B1%E5%83%8F%22%2C%22x%22%3A651%2C%22y%22%3A447%2C%22width%22%3A130%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%9F%BA%E5%9B%A0%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%22%2C%22x%22%3A652%2C%22y%22%3A397%2C%22width%22%3A136%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%88%86%E5%9D%97%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%22%2C%22x%22%3A653%2C%22y%22%3A192%2C%22width%22%3A132%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%AD%94%E9%A2%98%E6%80%9D%E8%B7%AF%22%2C%22x%22%3A16%2C%22y%22%3A240%2C%22width%22%3A130%2C%22height%22%3A36%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%22%2C%22x%22%3A334%2C%22y%22%3A241%2C%22width%22%3A135%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%98%BE%E5%AD%98%E7%88%86%E7%82%B8%22%2C%22x%22%3A653%2C%22y%22%3A133%2C%22width%22%3A131%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E5%B1%95%E7%A4%BA%22%2C%22x%22%3A331%2C%22y%22%3A396%2C%22width%22%3A145%2C%22height%22%3A37%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%98%BE%E5%AD%98%E7%93%B6%E9%A2%88%22%2C%22x%22%3A334%2C%22y%22%3A85%2C%22width%22%3A135%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%AD%E9%97%B4%E7%9F%A9%E9%98%B5%22%2C%22x%22%3A651%2C%22y%22%3A85%2C%22width%22%3A134%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%A1%AC%E4%BB%B6%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1%22%2C%22x%22%3A652%2C%22y%22%3A290%2C%22width%22%3A134%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BC%A0%E7%BB%9F%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%22%2C%22x%22%3A652%2C%22y%22%3A35%2C%22width%22%3A137%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%87%8D%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%22%2C%22x%22%3A651%2C%22y%22%3A241%2C%22width%22%3A101%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%95%BF%E6%96%87%E6%9C%AC%22%2C%22x%22%3A651%2C%22y%22%3A350%2C%22width%22%3A101%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f9f8f7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uc0bf2d63%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u79b49de8\" id=\"u79b49de8\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubf709d04\" id=\"ubf709d04\">FlashAttention的显存优化原理核心在于</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf4e60766\" id=\"uf4e60766\">避免存储庞大的中间矩阵</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud7987881\" id=\"ud7987881\">（注意力分数矩阵和注意力权重矩阵），通过</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uececf8bf\" id=\"uececf8bf\">分块计算（Tiling）和重计算（Recomputation）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u56a7a1b0\" id=\"u56a7a1b0\"> 实现显存效率的提升。以下是结构化解析：</span></p><h4 data-lake-id=\"58c7f557\" id=\"58c7f557\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua97226e1\" id=\"ua97226e1\">1. 传统Attention的显存瓶颈</span></strong></h4><ul list=\"uc53ffb30\"><li fid=\"u1ac3133a\" data-lake-id=\"ua39e829a\" id=\"ua39e829a\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4433c3fc\" id=\"u4433c3fc\">问题</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uafe67827\" id=\"uafe67827\">：标准Attention计算需存储中间矩阵： </span></li></ul><ul list=\"uc53ffb30\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"uc744dc58\" data-lake-id=\"ub8835ad6\" id=\"ub8835ad6\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubdf2e799\" id=\"ubdf2e799\">$QK^T$</span><span data-lake-id=\"u01034365\" id=\"u01034365\">矩阵（形状</span><code data-lake-id=\"uf009fd7d\" id=\"uf009fd7d\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue7b486b3\" id=\"ue7b486b3\">[seq_len, seq_len]</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u132915c8\" id=\"u132915c8\">），显存占用</span><span data-lake-id=\"u4f32d966\" id=\"u4f32d966\">$O(N^2)$</span></li><li fid=\"uc744dc58\" data-lake-id=\"u976b89c9\" id=\"u976b89c9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8c3bcf5c\" id=\"u8c3bcf5c\">Softmax输出矩阵（同</span><span data-lake-id=\"uf760b8fe\" id=\"uf760b8fe\">$O(N^2)$</span><span data-lake-id=\"u6edfd7b5\" id=\"u6edfd7b5\">）</span></li><li fid=\"uc744dc58\" data-lake-id=\"ub15981e8\" id=\"ub15981e8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9b2f1fc0\" id=\"u9b2f1fc0\">反向传播需存储这些矩阵的梯度，加剧显存压力。 </span></li></ul><ul list=\"uc53ffb30\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"u1ac3133a\" data-lake-id=\"u6f8012a7\" id=\"u6f8012a7\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1195bed9\" id=\"u1195bed9\">示例</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u729e3a59\" id=\"u729e3a59\">：处理8K序列时，</span><span data-lake-id=\"u7947d79a\" id=\"u7947d79a\">$QK^T$</span><span data-lake-id=\"uf5479102\" id=\"uf5479102\">矩阵显存高达</span><code data-lake-id=\"ua689d878\" id=\"ua689d878\"><span data-lake-id=\"u20c94aa1\" id=\"u20c94aa1\">8K*8K*4B ≈ 256MB</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u67a5634a\" id=\"u67a5634a\">，而大模型层数多（如65层），显存迅速爆炸。</span></li></ul><h4 data-lake-id=\"55d67a57\" id=\"55d67a57\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uae5669f9\" id=\"uae5669f9\">2. FlashAttention的优化原理</span></strong></h4><h5 data-lake-id=\"3ac42b4b\" id=\"3ac42b4b\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u60c3858c\" id=\"u60c3858c\">(1) 分块计算（Tiling）</span></strong></h5><ul list=\"uc6b77a51\"><li fid=\"u2f09e8d9\" data-lake-id=\"u9a10c2d2\" id=\"u9a10c2d2\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u215cc13b\" id=\"u215cc13b\">核心思想</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8cbe20e7\" id=\"u8cbe20e7\">：将</span><span data-lake-id=\"u31977180\" id=\"u31977180\">$Q$</span><span data-lake-id=\"u2b690e64\" id=\"u2b690e64\">、</span><span data-lake-id=\"ufcc31c72\" id=\"ufcc31c72\">$K$</span><span data-lake-id=\"u6ed9575b\" id=\"u6ed9575b\">、</span><span data-lake-id=\"ua04d26a0\" id=\"ua04d26a0\">$V$</span><span data-lake-id=\"u8efdb0b5\" id=\"u8efdb0b5\">切分为小块，每次计算一个小块的注意力输出。</span></li><li fid=\"u2f09e8d9\" data-lake-id=\"uf5464b57\" id=\"uf5464b57\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc4d7b963\" id=\"uc4d7b963\">操作步骤</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7820b926\" id=\"u7820b926\">： </span></li></ul><ol list=\"ue64c9233\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u4c7a221c\" data-lake-id=\"u120a7a78\" id=\"u120a7a78\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5694b493\" id=\"u5694b493\">将</span><span data-lake-id=\"u5633035e\" id=\"u5633035e\">$Q$</span><span data-lake-id=\"ub3f3e59c\" id=\"ub3f3e59c\">分成</span><span data-lake-id=\"ud27e2e84\" id=\"ud27e2e84\">$T_q$</span><span data-lake-id=\"ue91d49cc\" id=\"ue91d49cc\">块，</span><span data-lake-id=\"ue9976447\" id=\"ue9976447\">$K$</span><span data-lake-id=\"u5c1acba2\" id=\"u5c1acba2\">、</span><span data-lake-id=\"u9e9bd660\" id=\"u9e9bd660\">$V$</span><span data-lake-id=\"uf0a6b493\" id=\"uf0a6b493\">分成</span><span data-lake-id=\"u6b4cdac6\" id=\"u6b4cdac6\">$T_k$</span><span data-lake-id=\"u32c22f07\" id=\"u32c22f07\">块（如每块128 tokens）。</span></li><li fid=\"u4c7a221c\" data-lake-id=\"u6e40a98e\" id=\"u6e40a98e\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub2f7ae6d\" id=\"ub2f7ae6d\">对每个</span><span data-lake-id=\"u51acdb98\" id=\"u51acdb98\">$Q_i$</span><span data-lake-id=\"uabd957c4\" id=\"uabd957c4\">块，遍历所有</span><span data-lake-id=\"u33c6f9bf\" id=\"u33c6f9bf\">$K_j$</span><span data-lake-id=\"u1de62a7a\" id=\"u1de62a7a\">/</span><span data-lake-id=\"u249625dd\" id=\"u249625dd\">$V_j$</span><span data-lake-id=\"u3828fa04\" id=\"u3828fa04\">块，逐步计算局部注意力输出。 </span></li><li fid=\"u4c7a221c\" data-lake-id=\"u887762e0\" id=\"u887762e0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9b5ddbf7\" id=\"u9b5ddbf7\">通过动态更新</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1c4c80e2\" id=\"u1c4c80e2\">累加器</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub4551622\" id=\"ub4551622\">（存储当前块的输出和归一化因子）避免存储完整</span><span data-lake-id=\"u75bc8400\" id=\"u75bc8400\">$QK^T$</span><span data-lake-id=\"uc4c476cd\" id=\"uc4c476cd\">矩阵。</span></li></ol><ul list=\"uc6b77a51\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"u2f09e8d9\" data-lake-id=\"uc2aa3576\" id=\"uc2aa3576\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2d4c2c1d\" id=\"u2d4c2c1d\">显存优化</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5f7e792c\" id=\"u5f7e792c\">：<br />显存占用从</span><span data-lake-id=\"uc400e1d5\" id=\"uc400e1d5\">$O(N^2)$</span><span data-lake-id=\"ufa36e295\" id=\"ufa36e295\">降至</span><span data-lake-id=\"u04bd29bd\" id=\"u04bd29bd\">$O(B \\cdot N)$</span><span data-lake-id=\"u3c4ace01\" id=\"u3c4ace01\">（</span><span data-lake-id=\"u3e98762c\" id=\"u3e98762c\">$B$</span><span data-lake-id=\"u69a98cc2\" id=\"u69a98cc2\">为分块大小），典型值</span><span data-lake-id=\"u8ba45170\" id=\"u8ba45170\">$B=128$</span><span data-lake-id=\"u0913115d\" id=\"u0913115d\">时显存减少98%。</span></li></ul><h5 data-lake-id=\"941cce5b\" id=\"941cce5b\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua08f6ee6\" id=\"ua08f6ee6\">(2) 重计算（Recomputation）</span></strong></h5><ul list=\"u61c63704\"><li fid=\"u29206c73\" data-lake-id=\"u2b0b6a78\" id=\"u2b0b6a78\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2a74574d\" id=\"u2a74574d\">反向传播优化</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u86fd8b1a\" id=\"u86fd8b1a\">：<br />前向时不存储</span><span data-lake-id=\"u5c263685\" id=\"u5c263685\">$QK^T$</span><span data-lake-id=\"u7669cbdf\" id=\"u7669cbdf\">和Softmax矩阵，反向传播时按需重新计算小块结果。</span></li><li fid=\"u29206c73\" data-lake-id=\"ue22cf27d\" id=\"ue22cf27d\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6f590ef7\" id=\"u6f590ef7\">代价与收益</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u9fec5845\" id=\"u9fec5845\">：<br />计算量增加约15%，但显存降低3-5倍，使长序列训练成为可能。</span></li></ul><h5 data-lake-id=\"940d899c\" id=\"940d899c\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8c23a135\" id=\"u8c23a135\">(3) 硬件感知设计</span></strong></h5><ul list=\"u08c46b32\"><li fid=\"u17387663\" data-lake-id=\"u47564987\" id=\"u47564987\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2f866ee5\" id=\"u2f866ee5\">IO优化</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u46eeb625\" id=\"u46eeb625\">：<br />分块大小与GPU SRAM（高速缓存）匹配，确保数据在SRAM内完成计算，减少HBM（显存）访问次数。</span></li><li fid=\"u17387663\" data-lake-id=\"ufe86d836\" id=\"ufe86d836\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua6774d5c\" id=\"ua6774d5c\">效果</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf08906bd\" id=\"uf08906bd\">：<br />相比标准Attention，HBM访问量减少10倍，计算速度提升2-4倍。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"ud67c0430\" id=\"ud67c0430\"><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"6c12541a\" id=\"6c12541a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2f8877a8\" id=\"u2f8877a8\">二、项目案例</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ua692e3b2\" id=\"ua692e3b2\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1751689362412-1b3fd9b1-2e3a-47e6-801a-d956265d4d20.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u1c3b7d71-78e7-4a27-b633-cb9fb2d4283%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u1863dcd2-f6e4-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A470.93333333333334%2C%22height%22%3A259%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A89897%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A883%2C%22originHeight%22%3A486%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.875%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%8C%91%E6%A1%83%E6%88%98%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%22%2C%22x%22%3A678%2C%22y%22%3A176%2C%22width%22%3A131%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87%22%2C%22x%22%3A710%2C%22y%22%3A116%2C%22width%22%3A130%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8C%BB%E5%AD%A6%E5%BD%B1%E5%83%8F%22%2C%22x%22%3A361%2C%22y%22%3A381%2C%22width%22%3A144%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%88%86%E5%89%B2%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87%22%2C%22x%22%3A680%2C%22y%22%3A430%2C%22width%22%3A135%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%83%8C%E6%99%AF%E9%9C%80%E6%B1%82%22%2C%22x%22%3A709%2C%22y%22%3A19%2C%22width%22%3A148%2C%22height%22%3A36%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%22%2C%22x%22%3A709%2C%22y%22%3A67%2C%22width%22%3A136%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%95%BF%E6%96%87%E6%9C%AC%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81%22%2C%22x%22%3A363%2C%22y%22%3A68%2C%22width%22%3A158%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%9B%BE%E5%83%8F%E7%89%B9%E7%82%B9%22%2C%22x%22%3A677%2C%22y%22%3A333%2C%22width%22%3A135%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%87%86%E7%A1%AE%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87%22%2C%22x%22%3A678%2C%22y%22%3A274%2C%22width%22%3A132%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%22%2C%22x%22%3A45%2C%22y%22%3A224%2C%22width%22%3A126%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%88%22%2C%22x%22%3A678%2C%22y%22%3A383%2C%22width%22%3A136%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%88%22%2C%22x%22%3A678%2C%22y%22%3A225%2C%22width%22%3A130%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%9F%BA%E5%9B%A0%E5%BA%8F%E5%88%97%22%2C%22x%22%3A360%2C%22y%22%3A222%2C%22width%22%3A134%2C%22height%22%3A38%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f9f7f7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u8189c4d5%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h4 data-lake-id=\"9e506fa4\" id=\"9e506fa4\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud5ea3b8e\" id=\"ud5ea3b8e\">案例1：长文本摘要系统（序列长度8K）</span></strong></h4><ul list=\"ucebc36a2\"><li fid=\"u8db08984\" data-lake-id=\"u29af1d4a\" id=\"u29af1d4a\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ubd118017\" id=\"ubd118017\">背景</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u942b3d42\" id=\"u942b3d42\">：金融报告摘要需处理超长文档，标准Attention在A100上仅支持2K序列。</span></li><li fid=\"u8db08984\" data-lake-id=\"u2eb2084f\" id=\"u2eb2084f\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u014a554f\" id=\"u014a554f\">FlashAttention应用</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc96a0df4\" id=\"uc96a0df4\">： </span></li></ul><ul list=\"ucebc36a2\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u61a6ccab\" data-lake-id=\"u0ec6669e\" id=\"u0ec6669e\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf2016513\" id=\"uf2016513\">分块大小</span><span data-lake-id=\"uacba052a\" id=\"uacba052a\">$B=128$</span><span data-lake-id=\"ub6c89f66\" id=\"ub6c89f66\">，显存占用从48GB降至16GB。</span></li><li fid=\"u61a6ccab\" data-lake-id=\"ucab1261f\" id=\"ucab1261f\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucb6bc0d6\" id=\"ucb6bc0d6\">训练速度从3 samples/sec提升至9 samples/sec。</span></li></ul><ul list=\"ucebc36a2\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"u8db08984\" data-lake-id=\"uccb436b0\" id=\"uccb436b0\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub59fcd3a\" id=\"ub59fcd3a\">结果</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7bebbd2c\" id=\"u7bebbd2c\">：<br />模型支持8K上下文，摘要质量提升27%（ROUGE-L）。</span></li></ul><h4 data-lake-id=\"1bac101a\" id=\"1bac101a\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u88bb791b\" id=\"u88bb791b\">案例2：基因序列分析（序列长度100K）</span></strong></h4><ul list=\"u93f6c72f\"><li fid=\"uc331ee5c\" data-lake-id=\"u7d7db80f\" id=\"u7d7db80f\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1d607fb6\" id=\"u1d607fb6\">背景</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0f5df039\" id=\"u0f5df039\">：DNA序列分类需处理超长序列（10万+碱基对）。</span></li><li fid=\"uc331ee5c\" data-lake-id=\"uf97d41fc\" id=\"uf97d41fc\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u68acc96a\" id=\"u68acc96a\">挑战</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uded1f473\" id=\"uded1f473\">：传统方法需降采样丢失信息。</span></li><li fid=\"uc331ee5c\" data-lake-id=\"ud848278c\" id=\"ud848278c\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ufb703750\" id=\"ufb703750\">FlashAttention优化</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7ed54263\" id=\"u7ed54263\">： </span></li></ul><ul list=\"u93f6c72f\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u6dd51329\" data-lake-id=\"u0ed1eafa\" id=\"u0ed1eafa\"><span data-lake-id=\"u949c8f50\" id=\"u949c8f50\">结合</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf1a0e7fb\" id=\"uf1a0e7fb\">稀疏注意力</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7b81c3bc\" id=\"u7b81c3bc\">（局部分块+全局关键点），显存控制在40GB内（A100）。</span></li><li fid=\"u6dd51329\" data-lake-id=\"u77fd5860\" id=\"u77fd5860\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf3e930bd\" id=\"uf3e930bd\">比标准实现快22倍。</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u93f6c72f\" start=\"4\"><li fid=\"uc331ee5c\" data-lake-id=\"u0fecf963\" id=\"u0fecf963\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u369e1728\" id=\"u369e1728\">结果</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uaada3a09\" id=\"uaada3a09\">：<br />基因变异检测准确率提升19%。</span></li></ul><h4 data-lake-id=\"adfe136d\" id=\"adfe136d\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u26241bf1\" id=\"u26241bf1\">案例3：医学影像分割（高分辨率3D图像）</span></strong></h4><ul list=\"ubabf5e84\"><li fid=\"uc12d5dd0\" data-lake-id=\"u0e3c07d4\" id=\"u0e3c07d4\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ufb687e16\" id=\"ufb687e16\">背景</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6d49fb5b\" id=\"u6d49fb5b\">：3D MRI图像（512×512×512体素）需空间注意力机制。</span></li><li fid=\"uc12d5dd0\" data-lake-id=\"u031dfdfa\" id=\"u031dfdfa\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2a96e007\" id=\"u2a96e007\">问题</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u141da79f\" id=\"u141da79f\">：像素级Attention显存需求超80GB。</span></li><li fid=\"uc12d5dd0\" data-lake-id=\"uf9072817\" id=\"uf9072817\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud69958dd\" id=\"ud69958dd\">解决方案</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u73a97df0\" id=\"u73a97df0\">： </span></li></ul><ul list=\"ubabf5e84\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"uc9273084\" data-lake-id=\"uf1e31233\" id=\"uf1e31233\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue73ec5a9\" id=\"ue73ec5a9\">FlashAttention分块处理局部图像块（每块64×64）。</span></li><li fid=\"uc9273084\" data-lake-id=\"ub36f9440\" id=\"ub36f9440\"><span data-lake-id=\"udfe078a0\" id=\"udfe078a0\">显存降至18GB，训练时间从7天缩短至1.5天。</span></li></ul><ul list=\"ubabf5e84\" start=\"4\"><li fid=\"uc12d5dd0\" data-lake-id=\"u1dfbe719\" id=\"u1dfbe719\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud7732ac6\" id=\"ud7732ac6\">结果</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0b0f51c6\" id=\"u0b0f51c6\">：<br />肿瘤分割Dice系数提升11%。</span></li></ul><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22fG3hP%22%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"c1822661\" id=\"c1822661\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua72f8722\" id=\"ua72f8722\">三、示例回答</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u0481033c\" id=\"u0481033c\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1751689390183-ebfaa089-3bd6-46e6-9906-e0d6f0076bfe.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u3c7f6dde-b423-45bf-916a-71997f7b299%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u1863dcd2-f6e4-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A465.6%2C%22height%22%3A257%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A85311%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A873%2C%22originHeight%22%3A481%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.875%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%88%90%E6%9C%AC%E9%99%8D%E4%BD%8E%22%2C%22x%22%3A658%2C%22y%22%3A326%2C%22width%22%3A138%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%88%86%E5%9D%97%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%22%2C%22x%22%3A659%2C%22y%22%3A11%2C%22width%22%3A136%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%80%9F%E5%BA%A6%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87%22%2C%22x%22%3A662%2C%22y%22%3A268%2C%22width%22%3A133%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B%E5%9B%9E%E7%AD%94%22%2C%22x%22%3A21%2C%22y%22%3A217%2C%22width%22%3A140%2C%22height%22%3A36%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%98%BE%E5%AD%98%E9%99%8D%E4%BD%8E%22%2C%22x%22%3A660%2C%22y%22%3A219%2C%22width%22%3A135%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%A1%AC%E4%BB%B6%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96%22%2C%22x%22%3A659%2C%22y%22%3A109%2C%22width%22%3A140%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E%22%2C%22x%22%3A342%2C%22y%22%3A216%2C%22width%22%3A132%2C%22height%22%3A36%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%94%9F%E6%80%81%E6%89%A9%E5%B1%95%22%2C%22x%22%3A659%2C%22y%22%3A424%2C%22width%22%3A135%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%9F%BA%E5%9B%A0%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%22%2C%22x%22%3A658%2C%22y%22%3A170%2C%22width%22%3A144%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86%22%2C%22x%22%3A343%2C%22y%22%3A61%2C%22width%22%3A134%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93%E4%BB%B7%E5%80%BC%22%2C%22x%22%3A343%2C%22y%22%3A373%2C%22width%22%3A129%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%96%B0%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%22%2C%22x%22%3A658%2C%22y%22%3A375%2C%22width%22%3A106%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%87%8D%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%22%2C%22x%22%3A658%2C%22y%22%3A61%2C%22width%22%3A106%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f9f8f7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u0ad08932%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub950d976\" id=\"ub950d976\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3adedefa\" id=\"u3adedefa\">面试官</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u896b9f38\" id=\"u896b9f38\">：请解释FlashAttention如何优化显存，并举例说明实际应用。 </span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u31043eef\" id=\"u31043eef\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua609dc39\" id=\"ua609dc39\">候选人</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u38745648\" id=\"u38745648\">：<br />FlashAttention的核心是通过</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u082fbff6\" id=\"u082fbff6\">分块计算</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1f2fad21\" id=\"u1f2fad21\">和</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uba23126b\" id=\"uba23126b\">重计算</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4e862cb7\" id=\"u4e862cb7\">避免存储中间矩阵，将显存占用从</span><span data-lake-id=\"u1b3bca52\" id=\"u1b3bca52\">$O(N^2)$</span><span data-lake-id=\"u6e3ee945\" id=\"u6e3ee945\">降至</span><span data-lake-id=\"u6e4443d4\" id=\"u6e4443d4\">$O(N)$</span><span data-lake-id=\"ue8bcae7c\" id=\"ue8bcae7c\">。具体来说：</span></p><ol list=\"u6b45bf8f\"><li fid=\"uc3338bd7\" data-lake-id=\"u49503fa3\" id=\"u49503fa3\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u06db259a\" id=\"u06db259a\">分块计算</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ubf6f823b\" id=\"ubf6f823b\">： </span></li></ol><ul list=\"u09ddec2b\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"ub156c1c0\" data-lake-id=\"u6e060e01\" id=\"u6e060e01\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub3837d69\" id=\"ub3837d69\">将</span><span data-lake-id=\"u2166e534\" id=\"u2166e534\">$Q$</span><span data-lake-id=\"ua3b96a27\" id=\"ua3b96a27\">、</span><span data-lake-id=\"u14dadd17\" id=\"u14dadd17\">$K$</span><span data-lake-id=\"ucf02fe34\" id=\"ucf02fe34\">、</span><span data-lake-id=\"u99706b05\" id=\"u99706b05\">$V$</span><span data-lake-id=\"u43ad235e\" id=\"u43ad235e\">切分为小块（如每块128 tokens），每次计算一个小块的局部注意力。</span></li><li fid=\"ub156c1c0\" data-lake-id=\"ufeb0f15b\" id=\"ufeb0f15b\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub2848e62\" id=\"ub2848e62\">通过累加器逐步更新输出，避免存储</span><span data-lake-id=\"u32f60400\" id=\"u32f60400\">$QK^T$</span><span data-lake-id=\"u7ee02fa7\" id=\"u7ee02fa7\">和Softmax矩阵。</span></li></ul><ol list=\"u6b45bf8f\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"uc3338bd7\" data-lake-id=\"u0649790c\" id=\"u0649790c\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6af66f1f\" id=\"u6af66f1f\">重计算</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6d782807\" id=\"u6d782807\">： </span></li></ol><ul list=\"uba818c25\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u0ada556e\" data-lake-id=\"u8f6b428f\" id=\"u8f6b428f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u10761232\" id=\"u10761232\">反向传播时重新计算前向的小块结果，牺牲15%计算时间换取3-5倍显存降低。</span></li></ul><ol list=\"u6b45bf8f\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"uc3338bd7\" data-lake-id=\"u662a3e76\" id=\"u662a3e76\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uabebc4cd\" id=\"uabebc4cd\">硬件优化</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u33786388\" id=\"u33786388\">： </span></li></ol><ul list=\"u1a7e00a5\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"ud8f2f9f5\" data-lake-id=\"ud7ad1580\" id=\"ud7ad1580\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6c954e30\" id=\"u6c954e30\">分块大小与GPU SRAM匹配，减少显存访问次数，速度提升2-4倍。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u4b3c0f52\" id=\"u4b3c0f52\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u70646359\" id=\"u70646359\">案例</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u33bde621\" id=\"u33bde621\">：在基因序列分析项目中，我们处理10万长度的DNA序列：</span></p><ul list=\"u36b14b1a\"><li fid=\"u906d7941\" data-lake-id=\"ucfe3e29b\" id=\"ucfe3e29b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u979dbf0d\" id=\"u979dbf0d\">传统方法显存需200GB+，无法运行。</span></li><li fid=\"u906d7941\" data-lake-id=\"udbc318b3\" id=\"udbc318b3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u008fb7fa\" id=\"u008fb7fa\">使用FlashAttention（分块+稀疏注意力）后，显存降至40GB，速度提升22倍，分类准确率提升19%。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"uc0d747ac\" id=\"uc0d747ac\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub7024a76\" id=\"ub7024a76\">该技术使大模型能处理长文本、基因数据等高价值场景，是工业级大模型训练的基石。</span></p><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22zeKI6%22%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"2d325051\" id=\"2d325051\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua1343e3e\" id=\"ua1343e3e\">四、总结</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u74c96016\" id=\"u74c96016\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1751689409785-6d6cadf0-87c6-452d-b043-08366d7c147f.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ue35abf73-c7f0-4638-bef0-2ea4867f62d%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u1863dcd2-f6e4-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A418.1333333333333%2C%22height%22%3A177%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A54988%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A784%2C%22originHeight%22%3A331%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.875%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E4%BB%B7%E5%80%BC%22%2C%22x%22%3A267%2C%22y%22%3A63%2C%22width%22%3A130%2C%22height%22%3A36%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%94%9F%E6%80%81%E6%89%A9%E5%B1%95%22%2C%22x%22%3A581%2C%22y%22%3A271%2C%22width%22%3A147%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%9C%BA%E6%99%AF%E5%AF%B9%E6%AF%94%22%2C%22x%22%3A580%2C%22y%22%3A115%2C%22width%22%3A142%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%9A%E5%93%8D%22%2C%22x%22%3A265%2C%22y%22%3A219%2C%22width%22%3A137%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%98%BE%E5%AD%98%E5%AF%B9%E6%AF%94%22%2C%22x%22%3A583%2C%22y%22%3A17%2C%22width%22%3A142%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AE%AD%E7%BB%83%E6%88%90%E6%9C%AC%22%2C%22x%22%3A582%2C%22y%22%3A173%2C%22width%22%3A138%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%80%9F%E5%BA%A6%E5%AF%B9%E6%AF%94%22%2C%22x%22%3A584%2C%22y%22%3A65%2C%22width%22%3A132%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%96%B0%E7%AB%8B%E7%94%A8%22%2C%22x%22%3A582%2C%22y%22%3A222%2C%22width%22%3A98%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93%22%2C%22x%22%3A12%2C%22y%22%3A144%2C%22width%22%3A72%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f9f8f7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u91fbc5ad%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h4 data-lake-id=\"f8a85a3f\" id=\"f8a85a3f\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua633fc15\" id=\"ua633fc15\">FlashAttention的核心价值</span></strong></h4><table data-lake-id=\"xEibh\" id=\"xEibh\" class=\"lake-table\" style=\"width: 750px\"><colgroup><col width=\"250\"><col width=\"250\"><col width=\"250\"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id=\"u2533571b\" id=\"u2533571b\"><td data-lake-id=\"u323acca8\" id=\"u323acca8\"><p data-lake-id=\"uac330a88\" id=\"uac330a88\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc15d8e89\" id=\"uc15d8e89\">优化维度</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u151fda0a\" id=\"u151fda0a\"><p data-lake-id=\"u6721def4\" id=\"u6721def4\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1d5ac1d2\" id=\"u1d5ac1d2\">传统Attention</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"ud78f7513\" id=\"ud78f7513\"><p data-lake-id=\"u550fba0b\" id=\"u550fba0b\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3d1b00ce\" id=\"u3d1b00ce\">FlashAttention</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u4600b710\" id=\"u4600b710\"><td data-lake-id=\"u57a31905\" id=\"u57a31905\"><p data-lake-id=\"ucb27bcbd\" id=\"ucb27bcbd\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u67a70165\" id=\"u67a70165\">显存占用</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u172897f2\" id=\"u172897f2\"><p data-lake-id=\"ub6afbfec\" id=\"ub6afbfec\"><span data-lake-id=\"u599b1f69\" id=\"u599b1f69\">$O(N^2)$</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u5f43db46\" id=\"u5f43db46\"><p data-lake-id=\"u0ee5a902\" id=\"u0ee5a902\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2f9205de\" id=\"u2f9205de\">$O(N)$</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u93e0980c\" id=\"u93e0980c\"><td data-lake-id=\"u53823e8d\" id=\"u53823e8d\"><p data-lake-id=\"ua82bf424\" id=\"ua82bf424\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u55c2f9ac\" id=\"u55c2f9ac\">计算速度</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u34b2999d\" id=\"u34b2999d\"><p data-lake-id=\"u7a2aa669\" id=\"u7a2aa669\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4bd8ec52\" id=\"u4bd8ec52\">慢（频繁访问显存）</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"ub5c6ffef\" id=\"ub5c6ffef\"><p data-lake-id=\"ue4c58551\" id=\"ue4c58551\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7045001d\" id=\"u7045001d\">快（SRAM内计算）</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u4c90face\" id=\"u4c90face\"><td data-lake-id=\"u4bc6915d\" id=\"u4bc6915d\"><p data-lake-id=\"u746dd6a0\" id=\"u746dd6a0\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf2fa22ff\" id=\"uf2fa22ff\">长序列支持</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u4973df4e\" id=\"u4973df4e\"><p data-lake-id=\"u1895bec8\" id=\"u1895bec8\"><span data-lake-id=\"uebf0d958\" id=\"uebf0d958\">受限（如2K）</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u75fdc037\" id=\"u75fdc037\"><p data-lake-id=\"uba65dc25\" id=\"uba65dc25\"><span data-lake-id=\"uad0aa302\" id=\"uad0aa302\">支持（8K-100K）</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"ud5dfae76\" id=\"ud5dfae76\"><td data-lake-id=\"u201daae4\" id=\"u201daae4\"><p data-lake-id=\"u74c853f7\" id=\"u74c853f7\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf0e57fa9\" id=\"uf0e57fa9\">适用场景</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"ud2b3803e\" id=\"ud2b3803e\"><p data-lake-id=\"ucd8a61d4\" id=\"ucd8a61d4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u274a56be\" id=\"u274a56be\">短文本、低资源环境</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"uda07e442\" id=\"uda07e442\"><p data-lake-id=\"ub5a093db\" id=\"ub5a093db\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4b27bdd6\" id=\"u4b27bdd6\">长文本、科学计算、医疗影像</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><h4 data-lake-id=\"5a55deeb\" id=\"5a55deeb\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf071746b\" id=\"uf071746b\">行业影响</span></strong></h4><ol list=\"u0315aba9\"><li fid=\"u546cd978\" data-lake-id=\"u900d8da5\" id=\"u900d8da5\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u19180c4a\" id=\"u19180c4a\">训练成本降低</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue1490b5d\" id=\"ue1490b5d\">：使65B模型在消费级GPU（如3090）上微调成为可能。</span></li><li fid=\"u546cd978\" data-lake-id=\"ua3fbffae\" id=\"ua3fbffae\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub079da1a\" id=\"ub079da1a\">新应用场景</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5821fa5e\" id=\"u5821fa5e\">：推动长上下文模型（如128K的Claude）、基因分析、高分辨率CV发展。</span></li><li fid=\"u546cd978\" data-lake-id=\"u561bc693\" id=\"u561bc693\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u384ec635\" id=\"u384ec635\">生态扩展</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7891be70\" id=\"u7891be70\">：被vLLM、DeepSpeed等推理框架集成，成为大模型部署标配。</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u45726188\" id=\"u45726188\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uedb8ca10\" id=\"uedb8ca10\">关键点</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8ec86cb9\" id=\"u8ec86cb9\">：FlashAttention不是单纯“算法优化”，而是从计算范式上重构Attention，其思想（分块/重计算）已延伸至MoE、RetNet等新架构中，是大模型工程化的里程碑。</span></p>", "format": "lake", "word_count": 1417, "description": "一、答题思路FlashAttention的显存优化原理核心在于避免存储庞大的中间矩阵（注意力分数矩阵和注意力权重矩阵），通过分块计算（Tiling）和重计算（Recomputation） 实现显存效率的提升。以下是结构化解析：1. 传统Attention的显存瓶颈问题：标准Attention计...", "updated_at": "2026-08-16T08:03:48.000Z", "created_at": "2025-07-09T02:20:30.000Z", "id": 227234853, "status": 1}